**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/wwwroot/build
.git
.vs
.idea
**/.env
*.md
# The blanket *.md rule above would otherwise drop the tutorial chapters from the build context
# before the Dockerfile's own COPY ever runs — the Learning Centre would ship the img/ folder with
# none of the text next to it. See docs/tutorial/*.md, which the Dockerfile now copies at runtime.
!docs/tutorial/*.md
